&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of G-Suite, including Gmail, Google Docs, Sheets, and Drive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Familiar with Monday.com preferred, but not required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Ability to Multitask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Ability to Adapt Quickly Capacity for Rapid Adaptation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Work in an office environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
